type: "software"
abstract: >-
  The AI Agents Workspace Tools Library is a definitive zero-resource, self-healing,
  cross-platform task execution and workspace context library designed for autonomous
  AI agents, multi-agent swarms, and mobile/desktop developers. Built exclusively on
  the Python 3 standard library with zero external pip dependencies, it delivers sub-100ms
  latency across JSON data transformations, AST code refactoring, swarm orchestration,
  distributed resource locking, and system diagnostics on Linux, macOS, Windows (WSL),
  and Android Termux.
